#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:30
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "AUTO-JOIN"
msgstr "奧托-瓊"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:60
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Auto-Join"
msgstr "自動加入"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:62
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Auto-Join shows saved channels from your account auto-join list. Channels "
"with saved keys show only a +key marker; the key itself is not displayed in "
"the sidebar."
msgstr "Auto-Join 顯示您賬戶自動連接列表中保存的頻道 。 有保存密鑰的通道只顯示一個+key標記;密鑰本身不顯示在側邊欄."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:15
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Collapsible sections with clickable headers:"
msgstr "帶有可點擊標題的可摺疊區域 :"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "OPEN CHANNELS"
msgstr "打開目錄"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:53
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open Channels"
msgstr "打開頻道"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "RECENT PRIVATE MESSAGES"
msgstr "最近的一些私人言論"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:76
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Right-click a channel or PM row for context actions. Double-click a PM row "
"to open or focus that private message tab."
msgstr "右鍵單擊頻道或 PM 行進行上下文動作 。 雙擊 PM 行打開或聚焦私人信件標籤 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/keyboard_shortcuts.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"There is no dedicated keyboard shortcut for /me actions. Type /me directly "
"in a channel input."
msgstr "/me動作沒有專門的鍵盤快捷鍵. 在頻道輸入中直接輸入 /me."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The header shows the title, a close button, and compact counters for open "
"channels, recent PMs, and auto-join entries. You can also toggle the panel "
"via the toolbar."
msgstr "標頭顯示標題、關閉按鈕，以及開啟頻道、最近私訊和 auto-join 項目的精簡計數器。也可從工具列切換面板。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:37
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"- Active public channels you have not joined yet, plus a button that opens "
"the full channel list"
msgstr "- 尚未加入的活躍公開頻道，以及開啟完整頻道清單的按鈕"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "POPULAR CHANNELS"
msgstr "熱門頻道"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:67
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Popular Channels"
msgstr "熱門頻道"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:69
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Shows active public channels you have not joined yet when the server has "
"rooms to suggest. Click [+] to join a suggestion, or click \"Browse All "
"Channels...\" to open the full channel list dialog."
msgstr "當伺服器有可建議的房間時，顯示尚未加入的活躍公開頻道。點擊 [+] 加入建議，或點擊「瀏覽所有頻道...」開啟完整頻道清單對話框。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Named after your conversation"
msgstr "以目前對話命名"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— The title bar reads #channel[yournick] for a channel and "
"theirnick:yournick for a private message, followed by your identity state "
"and the member count. The taskbar button and the browser tab carry the same "
"name, so you can tell your chat tabs apart at a glance."
msgstr ""
"— 標題列顯示頻道的 #channel[yournick] 或私訊的 "
"theirnick:yournick，後面接著你的身分狀態和成員數。工作列按鈕和瀏覽器分頁使用相同的名稱，一眼就能分辨各個聊天分頁。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_account_dialog.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Account settings live in four windows — Account, Profile, Away and User "
"Modes — all reachable from the File > Account menu, the Start menu's Account"
" group, or the toolbar."
msgstr "帳戶設定分布在四個視窗中——帳戶、個人資料、離開和使用者模式——都可以從 檔案 > 帳戶 選單、開始選單的帳戶群組或工具列開啟。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_overview.html.heex:41
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Active call or P2P session, online buddy badge, lag, and mute state. Your "
"account state and current conversation are named in the window title bar."
msgstr "進行中的通話或 P2P 工作階段、線上好友徽章、延遲和靜音狀態。你的帳戶狀態和目前對話顯示在視窗標題列。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_account_dialog.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The chat window's title bar shows your nickname next to the conversation you"
" are reading, followed by your state: Guest, Identified, or Away."
msgstr "聊天視窗的標題列會在你正在閱讀的對話旁顯示你的暱稱，後面接著你的狀態：訪客、已驗證或離開。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_account_dialog.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Where Your State Is Shown"
msgstr "你的狀態顯示在哪裡"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "**bold** _italic_ `code` [label](https://example.com)"
msgstr "**粗體** 斜體 `code`[標籤](https://example.com))"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Choose IRC for classic control-code formatting, MD for Markdown, or TXT for "
"escaped plain text."
msgstr "選擇用於經典控制碼格式化的 IRC,用於Markdown 的 MD,或者用於逃避的純文本的 TXT 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "指令"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Format Selector"
msgstr "格式選擇器"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "IRC and Plain Text"
msgstr "IRC 與純文字"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"IRC remains the default and keeps the classic bold, italic, underline, "
"color, reverse, and reset controls."
msgstr "IRC仍然是默認的,並保持經典的粗體,斜體,下劃線,顏色,反向,以及重置控件."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Markdown"
msgstr "Markdown"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Markdown mode supports bold, italic, inline code, code blocks, block quotes,"
" lists, and links. Use Preview to check the rendered message before sending."
msgstr "Markdown模式支持粗體,斜體,內置代碼,代碼塊,塊引號,列表,以及鏈接. 使用預覽在發送前檢查已發送的消息 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_overview.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Message Format"
msgstr "訊息格式"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_overview.html.heex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Message Formats"
msgstr "訊息格式"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_overview.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"RetroHexChat supports IRC-compatible formatting, Markdown, and plain text "
"messages."
msgstr "RetroHexChat支持IRC兼容格式化,Markdown,以及純文本消息."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:47
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Slash commands are still parsed as commands before message formatting is "
"applied, so /join, /me, /notice, and other commands keep their normal "
"behavior."
msgstr "Slash命令在應用消息格式化前仍被解析爲命令,因此/join,/me,/notice,以及其他命令保持其正常行爲."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:39
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"TXT stores the message as literal text with HTML escaped and no presentation"
" syntax interpreted."
msgstr "TXT 將訊息按字面文字儲存：HTML 會被轉義，且不解釋任何呈現語法。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Text Formatting Overview"
msgstr "文字格式概覽"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The composer can send messages in three content formats: IRC, MD, and TXT."
msgstr "訊息輸入框可以使用三種內容格式傳送訊息：IRC、MD 和 TXT。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_overview.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The formatting toolbar changes with the selected message format."
msgstr "格式化工具欄隨所選信件格式而改變。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_message_formats.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The selected format stays active for new messages. When you edit a message, "
"the composer opens in that message's original format."
msgstr "所選格式會對新訊息持續生效。編輯訊息時，輸入框會以該訊息的原始格式開啟。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/formatting_overview.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Use the IRC, MD, and TXT selector beside the composer to choose how the next"
" message is saved and rendered."
msgstr "使用輸入框旁邊的 IRC、MD、TXT 選擇器，決定下一則訊息如何儲存和呈現。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:108
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A tail of what the server is logging right now. It streams only after you "
"press Stream, and stops the moment you press Stop or close the window — a "
"log stream nobody is watching is a cost with no reader."
msgstr "服務器正在記錄的尾聲 它只在你按下Stream之後流出,並在你按下Stop或關閉窗口時停止——沒有人看的日誌流是沒有讀者的成本."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A whole group grays out when nothing inside it applies, but it still opens. "
"That is the point: the menu is the same map wherever you happen to be "
"standing on it, so you can read what the app does before you are inside it."
msgstr ""
"一整組灰了出來 當它內部沒有,但它仍然打開。 這就是重點: 菜單是同一個地圖,無論你在哪裏 恰好站在它上,所以你可以讀到應用程序在它內邊做什麼。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:68
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Admin"
msgstr "管理"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"App Info answers the other first question — who is actually here. Channels "
"alive, distinct people present, calls in progress, virtual spaces running, "
"and a listing of which channels hold the people."
msgstr "應用 Info回答了另一個第一個問題——誰在這裏。 頻道生動,有特色的人在場,呼叫在進行中,虛擬空間運行,以及列出哪些頻道牽制人民."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Automation"
msgstr "自動化"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:72
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Charts start empty and fill as events happen. That is not a fault: nothing "
"was measured before you opened the window, and a line drawn back to the left"
" edge would be invented. Only the group you are looking at is subscribed, so"
" the window costs nothing for the groups you are not watching."
msgstr ""
"圖表開始爲空並隨事件而填充。 這不是一個錯誤:在你打開窗口之前,沒有測量到任何東西,並且會發明一條回到左邊緣的線。 只有您看到的組是訂閱的, "
"因此窗口對您沒有觀看的組沒有花費任何費用 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:100
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Database Stats runs one diagnostic report at a time against PostgreSQL: "
"cache hit rates, unused indexes, bloat, long-running queries, what is "
"blocking what. Nothing runs until you pick a report, because these are real "
"queries against the live database."
msgstr ""
"數據庫 Stats 一次運行一個針對PostgreSQL的診斷報告:緩存命中率,未使用的索引,bloat,長期查詢,什麼在阻擋什麼. 在您選擇報告之前,"
" 沒有運行, 因爲這些都是真實的查詢 與實時數據庫。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:99
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Disconnect sits alone under a rule at the bottom, where Windows 98 put Shut "
"Down."
msgstr "斷線在底部的一條規則下單獨坐着,Windows 98將關機關機."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "ETS Tables"
msgstr "ETS 表格"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Entries you cannot use right now are grayed out rather than removed. Open "
"Start ▸ Tools from the landing page and you will see Address Book, Notify "
"List and the rest in gray — they are real parts of the app, waiting for you "
"to connect. A grayed entry does nothing when clicked and never leads "
"anywhere."
msgstr ""
"你現在不能使用的條目是灰色的而不是去掉的。 "
"從登陸頁面打開“啓動工具”,您將看到地址簿、通知列表和灰色的其餘部分——它們都是應用程序的真正部分,等待您連接。 "
"灰色的條目在點擊時無所作爲,從不引向任何地方."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Grayed Out, Not Hidden"
msgstr "灰色出局, 不隱藏"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:114
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"If the level you pick is below what the server itself logs at, the window "
"says so instead of sitting silent. Entries below the server's own level are "
"dropped before any window can see them, no matter how long you wait."
msgstr ""
"如果你選擇的關卡低於服務器本身記錄的關卡,窗口會說,而不是靜靜地坐着。 服務器自身關卡以下的條目在任何窗口能看到之前都會被丟棄,不管你等待了多久."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:106
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Live Log"
msgstr "直播日誌"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Memory Allocators"
msgstr "內存分配器"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:64
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Metrics"
msgstr "計量"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:80
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Navigate"
msgstr "導覽"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:128
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"None of these windows refresh on their own. Each walk costs the server real "
"work, so refreshing is a button you press rather than a timer you forget you"
" started. Metrics is the exception: it is a live subscription by nature, and"
" stops when the window closes."
msgstr ""
"這些窗戶都沒有自己刷新 每次行走都要花費服務器真正的工作,所以刷新是一個按鍵,而不是一個忘記你開始的定時器. "
"Metrics是例外:它本質上是現場訂閱,當窗口關閉時停止."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:92
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "OS Data And Database Stats"
msgstr "OS 數據數據庫Stats"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:94
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"OS Data is the view from outside the server: the host's processors, load "
"averages, memory and disks. A server can look healthy while the machine it "
"shares is not. Readings the host will not report show as a dash rather than "
"as zero — those are different facts."
msgstr ""
"OS Data是服務器外部的視圖:主機的處理器,負載平均值,內存和磁盤. 服務器可以看起來健康,而它共享的機器卻不健康. "
"閱讀東道主不會報告爲零而不是零——這些是不同的事實。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:107
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"On a desktop a group flies out beside the menu; hovering another group "
"switches to it, so at most one flyout shows at a time. On a phone the menu "
"drills down instead: tapping a group replaces the list with its entries, and"
" the group's own row at the top takes you back."
msgstr ""
"在一個桌面上,一組飛出在菜單旁;徘徊着另一個組切換到它,所以最多一次一個飛出顯示. "
"在電話上,菜單會向下跳動:點擊一個組將列表替換爲它的條目,該組在頂部的自己行會帶你回來."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:105
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Opening a Group"
msgstr "開幕"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Overview is the window to open first. It reports which Erlang and Elixir the"
" server is built on, how long it has been running, how much traffic has "
"crossed it, and how close it is to the three ceilings that would end it: "
"atoms, ports and processes. Below those, one bar divides the server's memory"
" across the six things that consume it."
msgstr ""
"概覽是首先打開的窗口 。 "
"它報告了服務器所依賴的Erlang和Elixir,它運行了多久,流量跨越了多少,它離結束它的三個天花板有多近:原子,端口和過程. "
"在下面,一個欄把服務器的內存 分成了消耗它的六樣東西"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "P2P"
msgstr "P2P"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:39
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Processes"
msgstr "新聞"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Processes, Applications, ETS Tables, Ports, Sockets and Memory Allocators "
"are the same window over six different populations. Each one filters as you "
"type and sorts by any column with an arrow on it — click a heading once to "
"order by it, again to reverse."
msgstr ""
"流程,應用程序,ETS表,端口,Sockets和內存分配器是六個不同羣體的同一個窗口. "
"每個過濾器都按任何一列鍵入和排序,上面有箭頭——單擊一個方向,然後按它排序,再倒轉。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:120
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Reading Them Honestly"
msgstr "誠實地讀他們"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Sockets"
msgstr "襪子"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Groups"
msgstr "各集團"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Listings"
msgstr "名單"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:96
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Start Menu"
msgstr "啓動菜單"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The Start button opens the same menu on every screen RetroHexChat has: the "
"landing pages, the Connect screen, the chat, this Help viewer and the design"
" system. What changes between them is which entries are live."
msgstr ""
"啓動按鈕在RetroHexChat的每個屏幕上打開相同的菜單:登陸頁,連接屏幕,聊天,這個幫助查看器和設計系統. 他們之間的變化是哪些條目是直播的."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:122
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The listings show the first rows of a filtered set, and the count above the "
"table always says how many matched. \"50 of 771\" means you are looking at "
"the top fifty — never assume a listing is complete because it filled the "
"window."
msgstr ""
"列表顯示一個被過濾的集的第一行,表中上方的計數總是說有多少匹配. "
"\"771年的50個\"表示你正在看前50個——從不假設一個列表是完整的,因爲它填滿了窗口."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Where To Start"
msgstr "在哪裏開始"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "視窗"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— Perform, Auto-Join, Auto Respond, Alias Editor, Custom Menus and Timers: "
"the things that act on your behalf."
msgstr "——表演,自動Join,自動響應,異名編輯器,自定義菜單和計時器:代表你行事的事物."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— The windows of the screen you are on. Closing a window takes its taskbar "
"button with it, the way Windows 98 did; this is how it comes back."
msgstr "屏幕上的窗戶 關閉窗口時,會使用它的任務欄按鈕,就像Windows 98所做的那樣;這就是它是如何回來的。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:68
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— Users, Channels, Server Settings, Audit Log, MOTD, TURN, Broadcast, Danger"
" Zone, Console and Bot Management. Live only for administrators."
msgstr "——用戶,頻道,服務器設置,審計日誌,MOTD,TURN,廣播,危險區,控制檯和Bot管理. 僅供管理員使用 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— compare Block size against Carrier size. A wide gap is fragmentation: "
"memory the server holds from the operating system but cannot use."
msgstr "將塊大小與載體大小進行比較。 一個很大的缺口是破碎:服務器從操作系統中持有但不能使用的內存."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— every connection the server is holding open, with its endpoints and byte "
"counters."
msgstr "——服務器的每一個連接都是開着的,都有它的端點和字節計數器."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:39
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— sort by Mailbox to find a process receiving faster than it can drain. That"
" is what a stuck server looks like from the inside."
msgstr "——按郵箱排序,以找到接收速度超過排水速度的過程. 從內部看,這是一個卡住的服務器的樣子。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— sorted by memory. An in-memory table nobody prunes is the usual cause of "
"memory that only ever grows."
msgstr "——按記憶排序. 記憶中最常出現的是無名小卒"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_bot_management.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Roster"
msgstr "機器人清單"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_bot_management.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The window opens on the roster: every bot on the server, one row each. A row"
" carries the bot's description, the channels it is assigned to, the "
"capabilities it has enabled, how many custom commands it answers, and a "
"coloured dot for its process — green for running, amber for a bot that is "
"enabled but has no process, grey for one that was disabled. Selecting a row "
"replaces the roster with that bot; the Bots button at the top left returns "
"to it."
msgstr ""
"視窗開啟時顯示清單：伺服器上的每個機器人各佔一行。每行顯示機器人的描述、所在頻道、已啟用的功能、可回應的自訂命令數量，以及表示行程狀態的彩色圓點——綠色為執行中，琥珀色為已啟用但沒有行程，灰色為已停用。選擇某一行會以該機器人取代清單；左上角的"
" Bots 按鈕可返回清單。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_bot_management.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The General tab reports what the running process has actually done — uptime,"
" messages handled, commands processed — followed by the bot's identity: "
"nickname, command prefix, cooldown, who created it and when. A bot with no "
"process says so instead of reporting zeroes. Admins can use the Enable or "
"Disable button in the header to toggle the bot globally, or Delete to "
"destroy it."
msgstr ""
"「一般」標籤頁報告執行中的行程實際做了什麼——執行時間、已處理訊息、已處理命令——接著是機器人的身分資訊：暱稱、命令前綴、冷卻時間、建立者與建立時間。沒有行程的機器人會直接說明，而不是顯示一堆零。管理員可用標題列的「啟用」或「停用」按鈕全域切換機器人，或用「刪除」銷毀它。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_bot_management.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The Capabilities tab gives each capability a panel: what it does, whether it"
" is on, and its configuration. Settings are listed under the exact key /bot "
"set takes, so what is read here is what is typed in the console. Text a bot "
"was configured to say is shown with its colours rendered, not as raw control"
" codes. Admins can turn individual capabilities on or off; changes are "
"reloaded into the bot process."
msgstr ""
"「功能」標籤頁為每個功能提供一個面板：它做什麼、是否開啟，以及它的設定。設定以 /bot set "
"接受的確切鍵名列出，因此這裡讀到的就是主控台裡輸入的。機器人被設定要說的文字會算繪出顏色，而不是顯示原始控制碼。管理員可以逐個開啟或關閉功能；變更會重新載入機器人行程。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_bot_management.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The Events tab is the bot's own log: what it did, in which channel, and how "
"long ago. It loads when a bot is selected and pages further back as you "
"scroll."
msgstr "「事件」標籤頁是機器人自己的日誌：它做了什麼、在哪個頻道、多久以前。選擇機器人時載入，捲動時繼續往前翻頁。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A heading with an arrow on it can order the listing. Click it once to order "
"by that column, again to reverse. A heading with no arrow is not sortable — "
"the query behind it already decided the order, and the audit log is the "
"clearest case: it is a record of what happened, so it reads newest first and"
" nothing else."
msgstr ""
"上面有箭頭的頭可以命令上市. 點擊它一次按該列排序,然後再次反轉。 "
"一個沒有箭頭的方向是無法排序的——它背後的查詢已經決定了命令,審計日誌是最清楚的案例:它是發生的事情的記錄,所以它首先讀到最新的,而不是其他的."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/keyboard_shortcuts.html.heex:41
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Arrow Up / Arrow Down — Move the selection one row Home / End — First / last"
" row PageUp / PageDown — Move a screen of rows Shift+Arrow — Extend the "
"selection Ctrl+Click — Add or remove one row Ctrl+A — Select every row on "
"screen Ctrl+C — Copy the selection as tab-separated text Shift+F10 or Menu —"
" Choose which columns show"
msgstr ""
"向上箭頭 / 向下箭頭 —— 將選擇的一行 Home / end —— 第一行/ 最後一行 PageDown —— 移動一行的屏幕 "
"Shift+Arrow —— 擴展選擇的 Ctrl+Click —— 添加或刪除一行 Ctrl+A —— 選擇屏幕 Ctrl+C 中的每行 —— "
"將選擇的文本複製爲分頁的 Shift+F10 或菜單 —— 選擇顯示的列"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Choosing Columns"
msgstr "選擇欄"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Click a row to select it. Shift+click extends the selection to that row, "
"Ctrl+click adds or removes a single one. Once a row has focus the arrow keys"
" move the selection, Home and End jump to the ends, and PageUp and PageDown "
"move a screen at a time."
msgstr ""
"單擊一行選擇它。 Shift+ 單擊將所選區域延伸至該行, Ctrl+ 單擊添加或刪除一個單行。 "
"一旦一行有焦點,箭頭鍵會移動選擇,Home和End跳轉到結尾,PageUp和PageDown會一次移動屏幕."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Column Width"
msgstr "欄寬"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/keyboard_shortcuts.html.heex:46
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Column widths are set with the pointer: drag the right edge of a heading to "
"resize it, double-click that edge to fit the column to its contents."
msgstr "列寬用指針設置:拖動標題的右邊緣以調整其大小,雙擊該邊以將列與內容匹配。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:58
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Ctrl+A takes every row on screen and Ctrl+C copies what is selected as tab-"
"separated text, headings included — it pastes into a spreadsheet as columns."
" Only the columns you can see are copied, so hiding a column before copying "
"is also how you leave it out."
msgstr ""
"縮寫+ A 將屏幕上的每行和 Ctrl+C 複製所選擇的分頁文本, 包括標題 —— 它作爲列粘貼在電子表格中 。 "
"只有你可以看到的柱子被複制,所以在複製之前隱藏一個柱子也是你將它留下的方法."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:24
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Drag the right edge of a heading to make its column wider or narrower. "
"Double-click that same edge and the column fits itself to its longest "
"visible value — the fastest way to read a column of module names or MFAs "
"that is clipping."
msgstr "拖動方向的右邊緣使其列寬或窄 。 雙擊同一邊線和列適合其最長的可見值——讀取一個列的模塊名稱或正在剪切的MFA的最快方式."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:84
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Empty States"
msgstr "空國家"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/keyboard_shortcuts.html.heex:40
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/keyboard_shortcuts.html.heex:53
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Listings & Tables"
msgstr "列表與表格"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:66
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Live charts, one group at a time: HTTP, LiveView, Database, Oban, VM and "
"Domain. Domain is the server's own instrumentation — channels created, "
"people arriving and leaving, calls joined, virtual-space movement."
msgstr ""
"活圖,一次一組:HTTP,LiveView,數據庫,Oban,VM和域. 域是服務器本身的儀器——創建的頻道,到達和離開的人,連接的呼叫,虛擬空間運動."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:81
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Long Lists & Loading More"
msgstr "長列表加載更多( L)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:78
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Oban Health"
msgstr "奧班衛生"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:80
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Oban shows the background job system behind durable work such as RSS feed "
"polling, bot schedules, event logs, maintenance sweeps, link previews and "
"preference persistence. The headline cards separate supervisor health, "
"active jobs, retryable or discarded failures, successor coverage and pending"
" domain work."
msgstr ""
"Oban 顯示持久工作背後的背景工作系統,如 RSS 反饋投票,bot 調度,事件日誌,維護掃描,鏈接預覽和偏好持續. "
"頭條卡將主管健康、積極工作、可重試或丟棄的失敗、後續覆蓋和待決領域工作分開。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:8
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Ordering"
msgstr "排序"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Ordering is done by the server, not in the browser, so it reorders the whole"
" listing rather than only the rows on screen. That matters where the window "
"is showing the top fifty of several hundred: sorting by Memory really does "
"bring you the heaviest table in the server, not the heaviest of the fifty "
"you happened to be looking at."
msgstr ""
"訂單由服務器完成,而不是在瀏覽器中,因此它會重新排列整個列表,而不僅僅是屏幕上的行. 窗口顯示數以百計的前五十名很重要: "
"按記憶來排序,真的會給你帶來服務器中最重的桌子, 而不是你碰巧看到的五十張中最重的桌子。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:86
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Read the queue table by state first: Available means work can run now, "
"Scheduled means it is waiting for its time, Executing means a worker has it,"
" Retryable means Oban will try again, and Discarded means attempts were "
"exhausted or the worker gave up. The contract tables then show whether RSS "
"feeds and bot schedules have successor jobs, whether event-log jobs are "
"backed up, and whether maintenance or persistence work is falling behind."
msgstr ""
"首先按狀態讀取隊列表: 可用方式表示工作現在可以運行, 排程表示它正在等待時間, 執行表示工人有它, 可重試表示奧班會再次嘗試, "
"丟棄方式表示嘗試已經用盡或工人放棄. 合同表格然後顯示RSS種子和bot調度是否有後續工作,事件日誌工作是否備份,維護或持續工作是否落後。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:64
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Reading A Listing Honestly"
msgstr "誠實地閱讀列表"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Right-click the header row for the list of columns, and click one to switch "
"it off. The table closes the gap, so hiding two columns you do not need is "
"often enough to fit the rest without any scrolling. \"Show all columns\" "
"brings everything back."
msgstr ""
"右鍵單擊列列表頭行,然後單擊一鍵將其關閉。 表格縮小了差距,所以隱藏你不需要的兩個柱子往往足以適應其餘部分而無需任何滾動. "
"\"展示所有欄目\"帶回一切."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Selecting & Copying"
msgstr "選擇與複製"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:72
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Selection, column width and column visibility are yours alone and never "
"leave the browser. Nothing you do to the shape of a table changes anything "
"on the server or for anyone else looking at the same data."
msgstr "選擇、列寬和列可見度都是你的,絕不離開瀏覽器。 你對一個表格的形狀沒有做任何事情 改變任何在服務器上 或任何人看相同的數據。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:80
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "System Windows"
msgstr "系統窗口"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The System group under File ▸ System — and Start ▸ System — opens thirteen "
"windows onto the server itself. They are admin-only, and every one of them "
"only reads: nothing in this group can change the server, which is what "
"separates it from the Admin group beside it."
msgstr ""
"文件QQ系統下的系統組——並啓動QQ系統——打開十三個窗口到服務器本身. "
"他們只有管理員,每個管理員都只讀到:這個組中沒有任何東西可以改變服務器,這就是它與旁邊的管理員組分離的原因."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:66
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The count above a table always says how many rows matched, not how many are "
"drawn. \"50 of 331\" means you are looking at the top fifty of three hundred"
" and thirty-one. Where a listing can page, a Load More button sits beneath "
"it, and a marker appears once there is nothing left to fetch."
msgstr ""
"上方的計數總是說幾行匹配,而不是畫多少. \"331中的50\"表示你正在看前五十名的三百三十一. 列表中可以頁面的,一個 Load More "
"按鈕坐落在其下方,一旦無物可取就會出現標記."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The last visible column cannot be hidden — a table of nothing but blank rows"
" has no way back except the reset. From the keyboard, the Menu key (or "
"Shift+F10) opens the same list."
msgstr "最後一個可見的列是無法隱藏的——一張只有空白行的表,除了重置之外,沒有退路. 從鍵盤,菜單鍵(或Shift+F10)打開相同的列表."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:30
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The table itself is the same one every listing in the product uses: drag a "
"heading's right edge to widen a column, double-click that edge to fit it to "
"its longest value, and right-click the header row to switch columns off. "
"Rows answer the arrow keys once one is selected, and Ctrl+C copies the "
"selection as tab-separated text."
msgstr ""
"表格本身在產品使用的每個列表中都是相同的:拖動一個標題的右邊緣以拓寬一個列,雙擊那個邊緣以適應其最長的值,右擊標題行以關閉列. "
"行一經選定就回答箭頭鍵,Ctrl+C將選擇複製爲分頁文本."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:30
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The widths are taken from the first time the window drew and then held. That"
" is deliberate: a listing you refresh every few seconds would otherwise re-"
"measure itself each time, and every column would shift under you whenever "
"one value grew. Widths last as long as the window; closing it and opening it"
" again starts from a fresh measurement."
msgstr ""
"寬度取自第一次畫窗,然後保持. 這是刻意的:你每幾秒鐘更新一份清單, 否則每一次都會重新測量自己, 每當一個值增加時,每一欄都會在你下面移動。 "
"寬度與窗口一樣長; 關閉並再次打開它從新的測量開始 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_listings.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Wherever the product shows you rows — an admin listing, a runtime window, a "
"database report — it is the same table. Learn it once in the ETS Tables "
"window and you already know the audit log, the user listing and the Oban "
"queues."
msgstr ""
"無論產品顯示在哪裏行——一個管理員列表,一個運行時間窗口,一個數據庫報告——都是同一個表格. 在 ETS Tables 窗口中學習一次, "
"您已經知道審計日誌、 用戶列表和 Oban 隊列 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_system_windows.html.heex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "covers all of it."
msgstr "覆蓋一切."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"- Channels you are currently joined to, ordered by recent activity, with "
"user counts, unread badges, and highlight markers"
msgstr "- 頻道,根據最近的活動,您正在連接,命令用戶計數,未讀徽章,並突出標記"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:45
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Click a channel or PM to switch to it. Open channel rows keep unread badges "
"and highlight markers in one place; unread rows appear"
msgstr "點擊頻道或 PM 切換到它 。 打開頻道行保留未讀徽章並突出標記在一個地方;未讀行出現"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The Conversations sidebar is the left IRC navigation pane: joined channels "
"ordered by recent activity, recent PMs, auto-join channels, and popular "
"channel suggestions."
msgstr ""
"Conversations sidebar是左邊的IRC導航面板:由最近的活動,最近的PMs,自動連接頻道,以及流行頻道建議所命令的加入頻道."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The active channel is highlighted in the Open Channels section. New channel "
"activity moves that channel toward the top without changing the tab order. "
"Closing a channel tab leaves the channel, so joined channels and channel "
"tabs stay aligned."
msgstr ""
"活動頻道在開放頻道部分突出顯示. 新的頻道活動將該頻道移動到頂部,而不改變製表順序. 關閉一個頻道標籤離開頻道,所以連接的頻道和頻道標籤保持對齊."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Games"
msgstr "遊戲"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:86
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Language"
msgstr "語言"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The Start menu carries everything the app can do. Anything offered by a menu"
" bar at the top of a screen is offered here too — the Start menu is the "
"complete list, and the bars are shortcuts into parts of it."
msgstr ""
"「開始」功能表收錄了這個應用程式能做的一切。畫面頂端功能表列提供的任何東西，這裡同樣提供——「開始」功能表是完整清單，功能表列只是通往其中一部分的捷徑。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— Address Book, Notify List, Ignore List, Highlight Words, User Lookup, URL "
"Catcher, Channel List and Channel Central, followed by Nick Colors, Sounds "
"and Flood Protection."
msgstr "— 通訊錄、通知清單、忽略清單、強調字詞、使用者查詢、網址收集器、頻道清單和頻道中心，接著是暱稱顏色、音效和洗版防護。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:50
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— Audio and video calls, sending a file, playing a game, connection stats, "
"privacy mode and ending the session. Live only while you have a peer session"
" — except the entry explaining how to start one, which is live precisely "
"while you have none."
msgstr ""
"— "
"語音和視訊通話、傳送檔案、玩一局遊戲、連線統計、隱私模式以及結束工作階段。只有在你有對等工作階段時才可用——除了說明如何開始的那一項，它正好在你沒有工作階段時可用。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:86
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— Every language the app speaks. Picking one keeps you on the screen you are"
" on."
msgstr "— 這個應用程式會說的每一種語言。選擇一種不會讓你離開目前所在的畫面。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:92
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— Help Topics, the shortcut cheatsheet, the Message of the Day, the source "
"repository and its licence, and About."
msgstr "— 說明主題、快速鍵速查表、每日訊息、原始碼儲存庫及其授權條款，以及關於。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:62
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— Registering and identifying your nickname, then Account, Profile, Away, "
"User Modes, Trusted Terminals and Account Info."
msgstr "— 註冊並驗證你的暱稱，接著是帳戶、個人檔案、離開、使用者模式、信任的終端機和帳戶資訊。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— Retro Games, and the Arcade. The Arcade keeps scores against a nickname, "
"so it stays gray until yours is registered and identified."
msgstr "— 復古遊戲和大型電玩。大型電玩依暱稱記錄分數，所以在你的暱稱註冊並驗證之前，它一直是灰的。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:80
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— The public pages, the documentation, the design system and the way into "
"the app, plus Back and Forward through the Help viewer's own history. These "
"are real links, so they work with scripting off."
msgstr ""
"— 公開頁面、文件、設計系統和進入應用程式的入口，還有在說明檢視器自身歷程中的「上一頁」和「下一頁」。它們都是真正的連結，因此關閉指令碼也能用。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_start_menu.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— What the window in front of you is showing: toggling the conversation list"
" and the nicklist, clearing the window, copying the selected text and "
"finding text in it. In the Help viewer the same group switches between "
"Contents, Index and Search."
msgstr ""
"— "
"你面前這個視窗正在顯示的內容：切換對話清單和暱稱清單、清空視窗、複製選取的文字，以及在其中尋找文字。在說明檢視器裡，同一組用於在目錄、索引和搜尋之間切換。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Opens windowed"
msgstr "以視窗開啟"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The chat runs on a Windows-style desktop. The whole chat surface — "
"conversations, tabs, messages, user list and input — lives in one window "
"over a taskbar. The menus hang under that window's own title bar and its "
"status bar runs along its bottom edge, the way a Windows 98 program carried "
"its own; the desktop itself has no chrome."
msgstr ""
"聊天執行在一個 Windows "
"風格的桌面上。整個聊天介面——對話、分頁、訊息、使用者清單和輸入框——都裝在工作列之上的一個視窗裡。功能表掛在這個視窗自己的標題列下方，狀態列沿著它的下緣展開，就像"
" Windows 98 的程式各自帶著自己的一樣；桌面本身沒有任何外框。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:87
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The window layout — position, size, maximized state — is remembered while "
"the page is open, so moving between screens keeps it. Reloading starts from "
"the default layout again."
msgstr "視窗版面——位置、大小、最大化狀態——在頁面開啟期間會被記住，所以在畫面之間切換不會遺失。重新載入則從預設版面開始。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"— The chat opens centred, taking most of the desktop but never all of it, so"
" the taskbar and anything else open stay in sight. Maximize (or double-"
"clicking the title bar) fills the screen; you can also drag it by the title "
"bar and resize it from any edge or corner."
msgstr ""
"— "
"聊天置中開啟，佔據桌面的大部分但從不佔滿，好讓工作列和其他已開啟的東西保持可見。最大化（或雙擊標題列）會鋪滿螢幕；你也可以拖曳標題列移動它，並從任意邊或角調整大小。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:79
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"On a narrow screen the desktop shows one window at a time: the current "
"window fills the screen like a phone app. Its menu bar shrinks to a row of "
"icons — one per menu, tapping one opens it — and the Start button and "
"taskbar stay put; tap a taskbar button to switch between your open windows. "
"The same happens on a wide screen if you drag the window narrower than its "
"menus need. Windows can't be dragged, resized, minimized or maximized on a "
"phone; you just open, switch and close them. Dialogs and forms fill the "
"screen too, so they always fit."
msgstr ""
"在窄螢幕上，桌面一次只顯示一個視窗：目前的視窗像手機應用程式一樣鋪滿螢幕。它的功能表列收縮成一列圖示——每個功能表一個，點一下就開啟——「開始」按鈕和工作列留在原處；點工作列按鈕可以在已開啟的視窗之間切換。在寬螢幕上把視窗拖得比功能表所需還窄時，也會這樣。在手機上視窗不能拖曳、調整大小、最小化或最大化；你只能開啟、切換和關閉。對話方塊和表單也鋪滿螢幕，所以總是放得下。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Desktop App Folders"
msgstr "桌面應用程式資料夾"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Inside the chat, those folder icons launch the same windows, actions and "
"links as the Start menu. On Landing, Connect, Help and Showcase, Language "
"and Help stay available; the other desktop app folders show a dialog "
"explaining that you need to connect before those desktop apps can run."
msgstr ""
"在聊天中，這些資料夾圖示會開啟與開始選單相同的視窗、操作和連結。在著陸頁、Connect、說明和展示頁中，語言和說明仍然可用；其餘桌面應用程式資料夾會顯示一個對話框，說明你需要先連線才能執行這些應用程式。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"On a desktop viewport, the wallpaper shows app-folder icons for the main app"
" groups: View, Tools, Automation, P2P, Games, Account, Language and Help. "
"Admin and System appear there only inside the chat for admins. Windows and "
"Navigate stay in the Start menu. Double-click a folder icon to open a "
"Windows-style folder window with icons for that group. A single click only "
"selects the desktop icon."
msgstr ""
"在桌面視區下，桌布會顯示主要應用程式分組的資料夾圖示：View、Tools、Automation、P2P、Games、Account、Language "
"和 Help。Admin 和 System 僅在聊天中且你是管理員時才會出現在那裡。Windows 和 Navigate "
"保留在開始選單中。連按兩下資料夾圖示即可開啟一個 Windows 風格的資料夾視窗，裡面是該分組的圖示。單擊只會選取該圖示。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_desktop.html.heex:71
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The Start button opens the same base menu on every screen, grouped into "
"View, Tools, Automation, P2P, Games, Account, Windows, Navigate, Language "
"and Help, with Disconnect at the bottom. Entries you cannot use right now "
"are grayed out rather than hidden. Admin and System are shown only in the "
"chat when you are an admin."
msgstr ""
"開始按鈕在每個螢幕上都會開啟相同的基礎選單，分為 "
"View、Tools、Automation、P2P、Games、Account、Windows、Navigate、Language 和 "
"Help，底部是中斷連線。目前不可用的項目會顯示為灰色，而不是被隱藏。Admin 和 System 僅在聊天中且你是管理員時顯示。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"From the keyboard, Ctrl+Shift+] and Ctrl+Shift+[ walk through your joined "
"channels and open private messages without touching the mouse."
msgstr "使用鍵盤時，Ctrl+Shift+] 和 Ctrl+Shift+[ 可在你已加入的頻道和已開啟的私訊之間切換，無需使用滑鼠。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Reading something else does not leave the channel. A conversation you switch"
" away from keeps receiving messages, keeps counting unread, and keeps "
"flashing and playing its sound in the sidebar — you simply are not looking "
"at it."
msgstr "去看別的內容並不會離開頻道。你切換離開的會話仍會繼續接收訊息、繼續累計未讀，並繼續在側邊欄閃爍和播放提示音——你只是沒在看它而已。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Status Tab"
msgstr "狀態標籤"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:7
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Switching Conversations"
msgstr "切換會話"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"To actually leave, use the × on the tab, or right-click the channel in the "
"sidebar and choose Leave Channel."
msgstr "若要真正離開，請使用分頁上的 ×，或在側邊欄右鍵點擊該頻道並選擇「離開頻道」。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Use the conversations sidebar on the left to move between channels and "
"private messages. Click a conversation there and it takes the screen, "
"replacing whichever one the tab bar was showing."
msgstr "使用左側的會話側邊欄在頻道和私訊之間移動。在那裡點擊一個會話，它就會佔據螢幕，替換分頁列原本顯示的那一個。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:19
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Switching Away vs Leaving"
msgstr "切換不等於離開"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Buttons Beside the Tabs"
msgstr "分頁旁的按鈕"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Find is not one of them — it lives in Edit > Find, in the Start menu, and on"
" Ctrl+Shift+F."
msgstr "「尋找」不在其中——它位於「編輯 > 尋找」、開始選單和 Ctrl+Shift+F。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Space"
msgstr "空間"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Space is a second view of the conversation you are already in, not a place "
"of its own: the map replaces the messages and the message box keeps working."
" Switching to another conversation always lands you on its chat, so you "
"never arrive in a map you did not ask for."
msgstr ""
"空間是你所在會話的第二個檢視，而不是另一個地方：地圖取代訊息顯示，訊息輸入框仍可使用。切換到其他會話時總是進入它的聊天，因此你絕不會落入一張自己沒有要求的地圖。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The tab bar at the bottom of the chat area holds the things that can occupy "
"the conversation region: Status, the one conversation you are reading, and —"
" when that conversation has one — its Space. It is a switch between those, "
"not a list of everything you have open."
msgstr ""
"聊天區域下方的分頁列承載可以佔據會話區域的東西：狀態、你正在閱讀的那一個會話，以及——當該會話有的時候——它的空間。它用於在這些之間切換，而不是列出你開啟的所有內容。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_tab_bar.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The controls next to the tabs open something beside the conversation rather "
"than replacing it: channel settings, user lookup, the conference and the P2P"
" session. Each carries its label, so you can read what it does. On a phone "
"the first two also slide the conversations and user list open over the chat."
msgstr ""
"分頁旁的控制項會在會話旁邊開啟內容，而不是取代會話：頻道設定、使用者查詢、會議和 P2P "
"工作階段。每個都帶有文字標籤，你可以直接看出它的用途。在手機上，前兩個還會把會話清單和使用者清單滑出覆蓋在聊天之上。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_nicklist.html.heex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"A private message has no channel roles, so both of you are listed together "
"under Participants, the person you are talking to first. Bots keep their own"
" group in either kind of conversation."
msgstr "私訊沒有頻道角色，所以你們兩人一起列在「參與者」下，你正在交談的人排在前面。機器人在兩種對話裡都保有自己的分組。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_nicklist.html.heex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Collapse the list with the arrow in its title, and it becomes a narrow rail "
"that still shows the counts; click the rail to bring it back. On a phone "
"there is no rail: use the Users button at the end of the tab strip to open "
"it as a drawer."
msgstr ""
"用標題裡的箭頭摺疊列表，它會變成一條仍顯示計數的窄欄；點擊窄欄就能把它帶回來。手機上沒有窄欄：使用分頁列末端的「使用者」按鈕把它當作抽屜開啟。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_nicklist.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "In a channel, users are grouped by role and sorted within each group:"
msgstr "在頻道裡，使用者依角色分組，並在每個分組內排序："

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_nicklist.html.heex:58
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Right-click a nickname for Query, Whois, Add to Contacts, Ignore and Set "
"Nick Color, plus Kick, Ban, Op and Voice when you are a channel operator. "
"Double-click opens a private message."
msgstr ""
"按右鍵點擊暱稱可以使用 Query、Whois、加入聯絡人、忽略和設定暱稱顏色；當你是頻道管理員時還有 Kick、Ban、Op 和 "
"Voice。按兩下會開啟私訊。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_nicklist.html.heex:48
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Showing and hiding it"
msgstr "顯示與隱藏"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_nicklist.html.heex:42
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The strip under the title counts who is online, away and muted. A dot beside"
" each name says the same for that person: online, away, or — in a private "
"message — not connected at all, since the other person can be offline while "
"the conversation stays open."
msgstr ""
"標題下方的條帶統計在線、離開和被靜音的人數。每個名字旁邊的圓點表示同一件事：在線、離開，或者在私訊中——完全未連線，因為對方可以在對話保持開啟時處於離線狀態。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_nicklist.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"The user list is the sidebar on the right of the conversation. It lists "
"whoever is in the conversation on screen, and every conversation has one — a"
" channel shows its members, a private message shows the two of you."
msgstr "使用者列表是對話右側的側邊欄。它列出目前對話中的人，每個對話都有一個——頻道顯示它的成員，私訊顯示你們兩人。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_nicklist.html.heex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Who is here"
msgstr "誰在這裡"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:89
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Channels work the other way: Leave Channel actually leaves, so you stop "
"receiving what is said there until you join again."
msgstr "頻道則相反：離開頻道是真的離開，在你再次加入之前不會收到那裡的訊息。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:81
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Putting a conversation away"
msgstr "收起對話"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_conversations.html.heex:83
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Right-click a private message row and choose Close Conversation to take it "
"off the list. Nothing is deleted: the messages stay, and the next line from "
"that person puts the conversation back. It is not marked read either — if it"
" was in bold when you closed it, it comes back in bold."
msgstr ""
"在私訊列上按右鍵並選擇「關閉對話」即可將它移出清單。不會刪除任何內容：訊息仍在，對方的下一則訊息會讓對話回來。也不會標記為已讀——關閉時是粗體，回來時仍是粗體。"
